(350669, 27549, 7175, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.. the edges seem a bit blurry, as do the statues, and with the color balance being off from the flood lights, so ill give this a 6</td>', 'What a great shot.. the edges seem a bit blurry, as do the statues, and with the color balance being off from the flood lights, so ill give this a 6', '2003-07-09 01:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
