(350672, 27892, 4877, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Nice shot!!!  <br/> <br/>This feels like home for me.  I spent 7 months working in KL and lived a few minutes walk from KLCC with this view out my bedroom window!  Well captured with the fountains and the spot lights on the towers.<br/> <br/>Very well captured at night.  Nice framing.  Good luck!</td>', 'Hey!  Nice shot!!!   This feels like home for me.  I spent 7 months working in KL and lived a few minutes walk from KLCC with this view out my bedroom window!  Well captured with the fountains and the spot lights on the towers. Very well captured at night.  Nice framing.  Good luck!', '2003-07-09 01:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(350674, 27953, 6405, '<td valign="top">Here is the winning photo,10 from me and good luck!</td>', 'Here is the winning photo,10 from me and good luck!', '2003-07-09 02:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
