(350710, 27398, 9027, '<td valign="top">love the yellow glow and the shadows. seems he missed the party. everything is closed! :o)</td>', 'love the yellow glow and the shadows. seems he missed the party. everything is closed! :o)', '2003-07-09 02:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(350713, 27975, 9146, '<td valign="top">chocolate and chick reading....always my favorate night on ythe town</td>', 'chocolate and chick reading....always my favorate night on ythe town', '2003-07-09 02:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(350714, 27750, 7969, '<td valign="top">I know exactly where this is, very nice lighting capture, not sure how you did it, i know usually does not look this way-- good job</td>', 'I know exactly where this is, very nice lighting capture, not sure how you did it, i know usually does not look this way-- good job', '2003-07-09 02:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(350715, 27921, 1717, '<td valign="top">oh wow!  this is beautiful! the framing is great and the exposure is perfect!  definitely a winner....10</td>', 'oh wow!  this is beautiful! the framing is great and the exposure is perfect!  definitely a winner....10', '2003-07-09 02:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(350719, 27671, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, it really conveys the ambiance(sp?) of an old fashioned pub.  I guess all that is missing is people in old time garb, but the photo really conveys this without the people. I like the use of the sepia tones, I guess the only thing that bothers me is just how bright the 2 lights are.7.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, it really conveys the ambiance(sp?) of an old fashioned pub.  I guess all that is missing is people in old time garb, but the photo really conveys this without the people. I like the use of the sepia tones, I guess the only thing that bothers me is just how bright the 2 lights are.7.', '2003-07-09 02:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(350723, 27649, 7339, '<td valign="top">What an awsome shot. I love the arches and light so would be a good photo just for that but being in night on the town and add the person in the arch and this it just a great great shot. I hope to see this ribbon. 9</td>', 'What an awsome shot. I love the arches and light so would be a good photo just for that but being in night on the town and add the person in the arch and this it just a great great shot. I hope to see this ribbon. 9', '2003-07-09 02:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(350728, 27926, 9854, '<td valign="top">Lovely bridge. The reflection has such a nice deep  green color (on my Mac screen) , geatly complemented by yellows. Now, if the moon only happened to be as photogenic as the rest when you took this...it would get more than 9.</td>', 'Lovely bridge. The reflection has such a nice deep  green color (on my Mac screen) , geatly complemented by yellows. Now, if the moon only happened to be as photogenic as the rest when you took this...it would get more than 9.', '2003-07-09 02:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(350730, 27968, 7339, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, very strong emotion mixed with an excellent title. I immediately feel bad for her and want to go cheer her up. Good choice with the black and white to really adds to the whole scene. I gave it an 8</td>', 'I really like this image, very strong emotion mixed with an excellent title. I immediately feel bad for her and want to go cheer her up. Good choice with the black and white to really adds to the whole scene. I gave it an 8', '2003-07-09 02:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(350731, 27805, 9687, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Without knowing any details, possibly a slower ISO speed, and/or a neutral density filter may help to keep highlights from blowing, thus preserving the colour nformation (if there was any) too see more clearly the red, and green trails.</td>', 'I like this.  Without knowing any details, possibly a slower ISO speed, and/or a neutral density filter may help to keep highlights from blowing, thus preserving the colour nformation (if there was any) too see more clearly the red, and green trails.', '2003-07-09 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(350732, 27896, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a different take on the challenge. The shot is in great focus and the lights are interesting. The sky also adds to it I love how dark the clouds are they really stand out.6.</td>', 'This is a different take on the challenge. The shot is in great focus and the lights are interesting. The sky also adds to it I love how dark the clouds are they really stand out.6.', '2003-07-09 02:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
