(350735, 27884, 7339, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good picture overall. Sharp nice colors and lighting. Unfortunaly I find the large pink background to be distracting and brings down the image with to much pink. Good image otherwise.</td>', 'I think this is a good picture overall. Sharp nice colors and lighting. Unfortunaly I find the large pink background to be distracting and brings down the image with to much pink. Good image otherwise.', '2003-07-09 02:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
