(350744, 27959, 5964, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, I really like that fact that you included a person in the shot. The focus is good and the perspective is great. I am just bothered my how red the hues are, I am sure it was intentional but it just doesn''t sit that great with me.7.</td>', 'This is a cool shot, I really like that fact that you included a person in the shot. The focus is good and the perspective is great. I am just bothered my how red the hues are, I am sure it was intentional but it just doesn''t sit that great with me.7.', '2003-07-09 02:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(350746, 27642, 9687, '<td valign="top">Compositions is good, and I like the reflection in the water, but it looks a little flat, some levels / histogram adjustment might give it a little more punch.</td>', 'Compositions is good, and I like the reflection in the water, but it looks a little flat, some levels / histogram adjustment might give it a little more punch.', '2003-07-09 02:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(350749, 27549, 5964, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous setting! The bar int he upper right corner is a bit distracting, but I understand it is hard to work around all objects, also the lighting on the top part of the building is just too hot compared to the rest of the photo. Overall though, the shot is really nice.7.</td>', 'What a gorgeous setting! The bar int he upper right corner is a bit distracting, but I understand it is hard to work around all objects, also the lighting on the top part of the building is just too hot compared to the rest of the photo. Overall though, the shot is really nice.7.', '2003-07-09 02:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(350750, 28001, 9687, '<td valign="top">I bet you wish you could spot edit the horses "white eye", good photo, and good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'I bet you wish you could spot edit the horses "white eye", good photo, and good idea for the challenge.', '2003-07-09 02:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
