(351035, 27960, 342, '<td valign="top">i personally, like, sharp, crisp photos, and i do not think this photo can stand alone.  however, if it is to e used as part of a bigger project, with some narration around it, or an illustration for a short story, or a question, or a subject for a story or essay, then i think this is a terrific photo, and would also have worked well in the unanswered question challenge.<br/></td>', 'i personally, like, sharp, crisp photos, and i do not think this photo can stand alone.  however, if it is to e used as part of a bigger project, with some narration around it, or an illustration for a short story, or a question, or a subject for a story or essay, then i think this is a terrific photo, and would also have worked well in the unanswered question challenge.', '2003-07-09 09:17:19.000000', NULL, 1);
