(351861, 27960, 6150, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like it''s in focus but maybe that''s the point.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like it''s in focus but maybe that''s the point.', '2003-07-09 21:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
