(351895, 27826, 1379, '<td valign="top">PG is my ABSOLUTE FAVORITE!!  We saw this show TWICE, because he happened to swing through our area again, and both times it was incredible!!  Doesn''t he look like a little sperm about to penetrate the big bouncy egg?  I hope you enjoyed the show as much as we did.  Because of my enthusiasm for the subject matter, I am forced to give you a high score.  Thanks for submitting this!</td>', 'PG is my ABSOLUTE FAVORITE!!  We saw this show TWICE, because he happened to swing through our area again, and both times it was incredible!!  Doesn''t he look like a little sperm about to penetrate the big bouncy egg?  I hope you enjoyed the show as much as we did.  Because of my enthusiasm for the subject matter, I am forced to give you a high score.  Thanks for submitting this!', '2003-07-09 22:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(351903, 27465, 9854, '<td valign="top">Even the palm fronds blend well! Great looking shot!</td>', 'Even the palm fronds blend well! Great looking shot!', '2003-07-09 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(351904, 27671, 9854, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The only thing missing, IMO, is the bartender.</td>', 'Very nicely done. The only thing missing, IMO, is the bartender.', '2003-07-09 22:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(351905, 27903, 9810, '<td valign="top">I dont like it, you cant even tell its the moon.</td>', 'I dont like it, you cant even tell its the moon.', '2003-07-09 22:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(351906, 28006, 9810, '<td valign="top">This is like a picture I wanted to take, very nice!</td>', 'This is like a picture I wanted to take, very nice!', '2003-07-09 22:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(351912, 27893, 7229, '<td valign="top">And I usually hate black and white, but this is nice!</td>', 'And I usually hate black and white, but this is nice!', '2003-07-09 22:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(351915, 27649, 7969, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting, captured wide range of tones, and emotion of the person in the doorway, very nice</td>', 'very nice lighting, captured wide range of tones, and emotion of the person in the doorway, very nice', '2003-07-09 22:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(351917, 27901, 7229, '<td valign="top">maybe a better vote if it was bigger . . .</td>', 'maybe a better vote if it was bigger . . .', '2003-07-09 22:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(351918, 27276, 7229, '<td valign="top">the ever returning question aked of the attached male</td>', 'the ever returning question aked of the attached male', '2003-07-09 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(351919, 27750, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful exposure and great colors. I like the perspective on the railing - it''s "curveness" adds interest.</td>', 'Beautiful exposure and great colors. I like the perspective on the railing - it''s "curveness" adds interest.', '2003-07-09 22:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(351923, 27921, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. The rockets look a little like white christmas trees lit up at night. Great composition and capture of detail.</td>', 'Very nice capture. The rockets look a little like white christmas trees lit up at night. Great composition and capture of detail.', '2003-07-09 22:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(351926, 28008, 1323, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the building just isn''t very interesting.</td>', 'Nice idea, the building just isn''t very interesting.', '2003-07-09 23:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(351928, 27296, 1323, '<td valign="top">A great shot except for the JPEG artifacts.  The picture is only 50kbyte, thus you could have used less comperssion either on your camera or when editing in photoshop to take advantage of the 150kbyte size limit.</td>', 'A great shot except for the JPEG artifacts.  The picture is only 50kbyte, thus you could have used less comperssion either on your camera or when editing in photoshop to take advantage of the 150kbyte size limit.', '2003-07-09 23:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(351930, 27892, 1323, '<td valign="top">Petronas Towers? The framing seems a little odd.  The trees in the foreground don''t really add anything.</td>', 'Petronas Towers? The framing seems a little odd.  The trees in the foreground don''t really add anything.', '2003-07-09 23:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(351932, 27750, 1323, '<td valign="top">The yellow/orange tinge distracts from an otherwise great photo.</td>', 'The yellow/orange tinge distracts from an otherwise great photo.', '2003-07-09 23:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(351938, 27582, 811, '<td valign="top">I hope you know him, ''cause if you don''t, he might be coming to get you or something.  :-)</td>', 'I hope you know him, ''cause if you don''t, he might be coming to get you or something.  :-)', '2003-07-09 23:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(351939, 27802, 9907, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2003-07-09 23:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(351940, 27871, 9907, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2003-07-09 23:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(351944, 27459, 1323, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, although the flag is a little distracting from the focal point.</td>', 'Nicely framed, although the flag is a little distracting from the focal point.', '2003-07-09 23:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(351948, 27945, 9907, '<td valign="top">not bad</td>', 'not bad', '2003-07-09 23:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(351949, 27953, 9907, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2003-07-09 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(351950, 27938, 1323, '<td valign="top">The small file size indicates too much jpeg compression, which is apparent as artifacts in the picture.  Also, sorry about the dead pixel in your CCD.  Nice framing though.</td>', 'The small file size indicates too much jpeg compression, which is apparent as artifacts in the picture.  Also, sorry about the dead pixel in your CCD.  Nice framing though.', '2003-07-09 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(351952, 27944, 1323, '<td valign="top">Wow, $65 for Tim McGraw?  I think I just got a stain on my white T-shirt, and it wasn''t barbecue.  JK.  Nice clarity and a tasteful boder.</td>', 'Wow, $65 for Tim McGraw?  I think I just got a stain on my white T-shirt, and it wasn''t barbecue.  JK.  Nice clarity and a tasteful boder.', '2003-07-09 23:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(351954, 27975, 1323, '<td valign="top">I hope you excercised first!  Nice clarity, although a little lacking with "on the town".</td>', 'I hope you excercised first!  Nice clarity, although a little lacking with "on the town".', '2003-07-09 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(351959, 27649, 9196, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great angle</td>', 'Great idea, great angle', '2003-07-09 23:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(351962, 27731, 1323, '<td valign="top">I really like the border.  A sharper image would be nice.<br/> <br/>......Not really sure sharp is what I meant, but there''s just some lack of clarity, maybe it''s just blurry from the long exposure, and a little camera wobble?  Not really sure what''s up, maybe you could help me find the right word.</td>', 'I really like the border.  A sharper image would be nice. ......Not really sure sharp is what I meant, but there''s just some lack of clarity, maybe it''s just blurry from the long exposure, and a little camera wobble?  Not really sure what''s up, maybe you could help me find the right word.', '2003-07-09 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(351966, 27953, 543, '<td valign="top">Great concert shot.  The flash is a little harsh - something to diffuse it would have improved the look - but that backlight is all rock n roll.</td>', 'Great concert shot.  The flash is a little harsh - something to diffuse it would have improved the look - but that backlight is all rock n roll.', '2003-07-09 23:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(351967, 27276, 554, '<td valign="top">"No dear, it\''s your big butt that makes you look fat."</td>', '"No dear, it\''s your big butt that makes you look fat."', '2003-07-09 23:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(351969, 27628, 543, '<td valign="top">This really calls out for a wider angle lens.  Frustrating, isn''t it?  If there was any room to back up, it would have been nice to see some ground in the foreground rather than having the people''s torsos growing out of the bottom of the image.</td>', 'This really calls out for a wider angle lens.  Frustrating, isn''t it?  If there was any room to back up, it would have been nice to see some ground in the foreground rather than having the people''s torsos growing out of the bottom of the image.', '2003-07-09 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(351970, 27871, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and colors.  Why not a vertical composition?  Might have better emphasized the skyward tendency of your subject.</td>', 'Nice symmetry and colors.  Why not a vertical composition?  Might have better emphasized the skyward tendency of your subject.', '2003-07-09 23:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(351971, 27892, 543, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred more of the tops of the towers and less of the dark water.  Probably not possible to get all of it from this close without a tilt/shift.  Good sharpness and WB.</td>', 'I''d have preferred more of the tops of the towers and less of the dark water.  Probably not possible to get all of it from this close without a tilt/shift.  Good sharpness and WB.', '2003-07-09 23:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(351972, 27870, 543, '<td valign="top">The lipstick tells the story.  Nicely done.  A little warmer tone might better suit the mood, but ya takes what ya sees.</td>', 'The lipstick tells the story.  Nicely done.  A little warmer tone might better suit the mood, but ya takes what ya sees.', '2003-07-09 23:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(351973, 27771, 543, '<td valign="top">What''s the story on that shadow behind his hand?  Painted ceiling?  Off camera flash (yeah... I know) would make for more even lighting.</td>', 'What''s the story on that shadow behind his hand?  Painted ceiling?  Off camera flash (yeah... I know) would make for more even lighting.', '2003-07-10 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
