(352099, 27971, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty good "opposite" perspective on this shot.  I like how everyone is perfectly focused on what they are seeing.</td>', 'Pretty good "opposite" perspective on this shot.  I like how everyone is perfectly focused on what they are seeing.', '2003-07-10 01:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
