(352219, 28002, 3540, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of neat things here.  Maybe too many.  There seems to be nothing legitimately level here.  Is this a fisheye lens trick or am i just seeing things?  The fountain would''ve been the focus of this photo if I were submitting it.  Its gorgeous.   Great exposure on it.</td>', 'There are a lot of neat things here.  Maybe too many.  There seems to be nothing legitimately level here.  Is this a fisheye lens trick or am i just seeing things?  The fountain would''ve been the focus of this photo if I were submitting it.  Its gorgeous.   Great exposure on it.', '2003-07-10 06:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(352221, 27908, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if it were zoomed up past the bikes and railings.  Excellent subject and one that lends itself well to being photographed.  Great subject and not a bad photo either.</td>', 'I would like this better if it were zoomed up past the bikes and railings.  Excellent subject and one that lends itself well to being photographed.  Great subject and not a bad photo either.', '2003-07-10 06:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
