(352359, 27921, 8139, '<td valign="top">One of the best fireworks pic of this challenge: reflections in water, the people ''s silhouettes, choice of duotone, composition... <br/>Great picture.</td>', 'One of the best fireworks pic of this challenge: reflections in water, the people ''s silhouettes, choice of duotone, composition... Great picture.', '2003-07-10 09:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(352361, 27925, 8139, '<td valign="top">Superb composition, black and white colors make this photo very aestetic.</td>', 'Superb composition, black and white colors make this photo very aestetic.', '2003-07-10 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(352377, 28000, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, my only 10 this challenge. I love the top of the leg! Looks great in black and white, effective exposure... the slightly overexposed look works well. Shame about the wrinkles in the stocking at the bottom of the foot at the back. The leg itself is mmmm gorgeous! 10</td>', 'Beautiful image, my only 10 this challenge. I love the top of the leg! Looks great in black and white, effective exposure... the slightly overexposed look works well. Shame about the wrinkles in the stocking at the bottom of the foot at the back. The leg itself is mmmm gorgeous! 10', '2003-07-10 10:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(352380, 27968, 8522, '<td valign="top">A poignant shot. A shame about the background... the pole growing out of her back is distracting and the items in front of the fence to the left of her are very noisy and don''t look so great. A sharper focus on the subject would have helped... a side effect is that the bench would be in sharp focus as well. A nice concept for this challenge. 8</td>', 'A poignant shot. A shame about the background... the pole growing out of her back is distracting and the items in front of the fence to the left of her are very noisy and don''t look so great. A sharper focus on the subject would have helped... a side effect is that the bench would be in sharp focus as well. A nice concept for this challenge. 8', '2003-07-10 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(352381, 27457, 8522, '<td valign="top">You must be a drummer! Methinks the focus here is not the entertainer, but the woman with a nice smile on the left! The composition is a bit cluttered for my taste, the eye finds it difficult to know where to settle. I like the collection of bottles though, they add interesting patterns to this photo. The fact that some of the woman''s face in the middle has been cut off is a bit disconcerting. Great atmosphere though. 7</td>', 'You must be a drummer! Methinks the focus here is not the entertainer, but the woman with a nice smile on the left! The composition is a bit cluttered for my taste, the eye finds it difficult to know where to settle. I like the collection of bottles though, they add interesting patterns to this photo. The fact that some of the woman''s face in the middle has been cut off is a bit disconcerting. Great atmosphere though. 7', '2003-07-10 10:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(352383, 27977, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great concept, shame it isn''t sharper. The cropping is particularly effective. Great dof, the background is nicely blurred. I think I''d have liked this in colour with warm tones... oranges and reds. In black and white, it almost looks like it could be a business lunch. 7</td>', 'Great concept, shame it isn''t sharper. The cropping is particularly effective. Great dof, the background is nicely blurred. I think I''d have liked this in colour with warm tones... oranges and reds. In black and white, it almost looks like it could be a business lunch. 7', '2003-07-10 10:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(352388, 27663, 9913, '<td valign="top">I would have added some puke on this pic...;)</td>', 'I would have added some puke on this pic...;)', '2003-07-10 11:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(352389, 27457, 9913, '<td valign="top">I take it you are the drummer?....<br/>nice point of view but a rather dull scene though...</td>', 'I take it you are the drummer?....nice point of view but a rather dull scene though...', '2003-07-10 11:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
