(352420, 27901, 8701, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but executed not too well. heres what i would have done. First, a larger image, second, have the person standing in the middle of the road if possible ( you may have to wait until really late for the cars to stop coming) and take the shot from a different angle facing directly him or off centered under a street light.</td>', 'Good idea, but executed not too well. heres what i would have done. First, a larger image, second, have the person standing in the middle of the road if possible ( you may have to wait until really late for the cars to stop coming) and take the shot from a different angle facing directly him or off centered under a street light.', '2003-07-10 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
