(352528, 27783, 9893, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows casted from the tree &amp; bench.  However, it seems a bit over-exposed.</td>', 'I like the shadows casted from the tree & bench.  However, it seems a bit over-exposed.', '2003-07-10 15:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(352533, 27944, 9893, '<td valign="top">Thats a ridiculous price for a show...<br/>Great still-life though.  I like how you leave the actual event up to the imagination.</td>', 'Thats a ridiculous price for a show...Great still-life though.  I like how you leave the actual event up to the imagination.', '2003-07-10 15:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(352534, 27959, 9893, '<td valign="top">Great composition &amp; use of natural lighting!</td>', 'Great composition & use of natural lighting!', '2003-07-10 15:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(352540, 27801, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the theme, but I think with the crystal blending in so well with the pattern of the linens, there seems to be a little too much unused space at the top left. This makes the whole shot feel unbalanced. I would also like to see the bottom of the plate and silver not cut off since those really are the focal point in the shot. Interesting and unique idea for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the colors and the theme, but I think with the crystal blending in so well with the pattern of the linens, there seems to be a little too much unused space at the top left. This makes the whole shot feel unbalanced. I would also like to see the bottom of the plate and silver not cut off since those really are the focal point in the shot. Interesting and unique idea for this challenge.', '2003-07-10 15:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(352544, 27889, 9295, '<td valign="top">Captures the theme but I think the lights are a little distracting from  your subject whose face seems a little too shadowed. Since your title is "Dancing Dude," my eye should be drawn more to him but instead it goes right to the light.  It also seems out of focus.</td>', 'Captures the theme but I think the lights are a little distracting from  your subject whose face seems a little too shadowed. Since your title is "Dancing Dude," my eye should be drawn more to him but instead it goes right to the light.  It also seems out of focus.', '2003-07-10 15:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(352546, 27530, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a cool silhouette shot and captures the theme of the challenge nicely. The two lights behind the fountain are a little distracting though and, although your subjects are centered, the fountain is not.  I think in this case, centered would look better.</td>', 'This is a cool silhouette shot and captures the theme of the challenge nicely. The two lights behind the fountain are a little distracting though and, although your subjects are centered, the fountain is not.  I think in this case, centered would look better.', '2003-07-10 15:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(352548, 27896, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting view but the photo doesn''t really capture my attention or imagination.</td>', 'This is an interesting view but the photo doesn''t really capture my attention or imagination.', '2003-07-10 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(352550, 27783, 8701, '<td valign="top">Definetley amazing. But! too bright a light, distracting background, maybe you should have went scouting for a different area with a bench perhaps a lake, but great idea and i cant even put into words what kind of photo this is. 8</td>', 'Definetley amazing. But! too bright a light, distracting background, maybe you should have went scouting for a different area with a bench perhaps a lake, but great idea and i cant even put into words what kind of photo this is. 8', '2003-07-10 15:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(352552, 27334, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is humorous and nicely photographed. I particularly like the three bright lights in the background. Unfortunately, there is something about the tan tone of the foreground that takes away from the city lights in the back.</td>', 'This is humorous and nicely photographed. I particularly like the three bright lights in the background. Unfortunately, there is something about the tan tone of the foreground that takes away from the city lights in the back.', '2003-07-10 15:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(352553, 27731, 8701, '<td valign="top">Well, good shot of the building, but from the title i suspect the main subject of intent was the paddle boat, so its only appropriate that you zoom in more on the paddle boat, mabye take the shot from a lower area so you could have a closer look at the boat but at the same time keep the building in view.</td>', 'Well, good shot of the building, but from the title i suspect the main subject of intent was the paddle boat, so its only appropriate that you zoom in more on the paddle boat, mabye take the shot from a lower area so you could have a closer look at the boat but at the same time keep the building in view.', '2003-07-10 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(352554, 27921, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think for a fireworks shot to work in this challenge, it''s important to include people enjoying them. You did that well by including the silhouettes in the foreground.  I''d like to see this in color, although the tan tones does have a cool feel to it.</td>', 'I think for a fireworks shot to work in this challenge, it''s important to include people enjoying them. You did that well by including the silhouettes in the foreground.  I''d like to see this in color, although the tan tones does have a cool feel to it.', '2003-07-10 15:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(352555, 27892, 8701, '<td valign="top">Great shot, i cant see anything wrong with it.</td>', 'Great shot, i cant see anything wrong with it.', '2003-07-10 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(352557, 28007, 8701, '<td valign="top">Not too much of interest here, looks like a simple snapshot.</td>', 'Not too much of interest here, looks like a simple snapshot.', '2003-07-10 15:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(352558, 27830, 9295, '<td valign="top">This would better fit a challenge of A Town at Night rather than A NIght on the Town. However, my personal opinion of the importance of meeting a challenge aside, the photo itself lacks "oomph."  The building of focus seems soft in its focus and it just doesn''t grab me the way it probably should.</td>', 'This would better fit a challenge of A Town at Night rather than A NIght on the Town. However, my personal opinion of the importance of meeting a challenge aside, the photo itself lacks "oomph."  The building of focus seems soft in its focus and it just doesn''t grab me the way it probably should.', '2003-07-10 15:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(352559, 27866, 8701, '<td valign="top">Great idea. but, the background (not the bush) should be darker so you couldnt see it, maybe a higher shutter speed and higher iso. 8</td>', 'Great idea. but, the background (not the bush) should be darker so you couldnt see it, maybe a higher shutter speed and higher iso. 8', '2003-07-10 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(352561, 27969, 9295, '<td valign="top">The trouble with this technique of capturing the people in motion is that stationary things like the tree and the building are also out of focus.  The result is, instead of a really unique shot of this street corner, I see a something that looks like the camera was dropped as the picture was being taken.  It''s a little hard on the eyes I''m afraid.</td>', 'The trouble with this technique of capturing the people in motion is that stationary things like the tree and the building are also out of focus.  The result is, instead of a really unique shot of this street corner, I see a something that looks like the camera was dropped as the picture was being taken.  It''s a little hard on the eyes I''m afraid.', '2003-07-10 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(352563, 27642, 9295, '<td valign="top">A beautifully done shot of the harbor at night. It feels almost like a painting.</td>', 'A beautifully done shot of the harbor at night. It feels almost like a painting.', '2003-07-10 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(352564, 27893, 8701, '<td valign="top">Amazing!!!! easy 10, not a thing wrong in the photo (as far as i could see) i wouldnt have changed one thing, I hope you win!</td>', 'Amazing!!!! easy 10, not a thing wrong in the photo (as far as i could see) i wouldnt have changed one thing, I hope you win!', '2003-07-10 15:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(352565, 28001, 9295, '<td valign="top">Too dark. Her shirt becomes the focal point of the shot. Also, I''m not sure if you intended to have the photo "lean" but it seems to and in this case, it doesn''t work too well for me.</td>', 'Too dark. Her shirt becomes the focal point of the shot. Also, I''m not sure if you intended to have the photo "lean" but it seems to and in this case, it doesn''t work too well for me.', '2003-07-10 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(352566, 27671, 8701, '<td valign="top">good shot but theres not enough going on, maybe wait until the bartender came, or you could have asked some one to stand behind the counter and clean a glass or something and pose as the bartender, 7</td>', 'good shot but theres not enough going on, maybe wait until the bartender came, or you could have asked some one to stand behind the counter and clean a glass or something and pose as the bartender, 7', '2003-07-10 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352572, 27968, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like how you chose to go a different direction from the "typical" idea of A Night on the Town. Just my humble little opinion (I like the shot a lot) but I think it would have been even more effective if she was in black shoes (maybe heels). The white sandals are a little too bright for the mood you have going here.</td>', 'I like how you chose to go a different direction from the "typical" idea of A Night on the Town. Just my humble little opinion (I like the shot a lot) but I think it would have been even more effective if she was in black shoes (maybe heels). The white sandals are a little too bright for the mood you have going here.', '2003-07-10 15:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(352584, 27750, 2612, '<td valign="top">I really like the converging lines and repetition in the railing. The boat on the far left and the bring highlight of the lamps pulls me away from the lines of the railing and walkway that I find most interesting.</td>', 'I really like the converging lines and repetition in the railing. The boat on the far left and the bring highlight of the lamps pulls me away from the lines of the railing and walkway that I find most interesting.', '2003-07-10 16:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(352585, 28000, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like the stong diagonal lines provided by the leg and the door frame. The simplicity and nice leg are also appealing to me. Only improvement might have been something more to suggest night, given the challenge.</td>', 'I like the stong diagonal lines provided by the leg and the door frame. The simplicity and nice leg are also appealing to me. Only improvement might have been something more to suggest night, given the challenge.', '2003-07-10 16:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(352586, 27398, 9886, '<td valign="top">Perhaps could''ve done with a few shady characters with ankle length jackets lingering in the shadows, but I love the drunken swagger ... something I believe i''ve perfected ;). I think the silouhette (typo?) works well also.<br/>7.</td>', 'Perhaps could''ve done with a few shady characters with ankle length jackets lingering in the shadows, but I love the drunken swagger ... something I believe i''ve perfected ;). I think the silouhette (typo?) works well also.7.', '2003-07-10 16:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(352589, 27668, 9886, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed with the bollards. Also good to have an alternative quieter, smaller English town rather than a lot of glitz and neon everywhere. I wish the HSBC sign was cropped out (mainly because they wouldn''t give me a debit card!). 7.</td>', 'Nicely framed with the bollards. Also good to have an alternative quieter, smaller English town rather than a lot of glitz and neon everywhere. I wish the HSBC sign was cropped out (mainly because they wouldn''t give me a debit card!). 7.', '2003-07-10 16:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(352592, 28009, 9886, '<td valign="top">Really nice, I love the way it''s isolated from everything even though there''s probably a dozen others like it nearby. Pleasent glow also. 7.</td>', 'Really nice, I love the way it''s isolated from everything even though there''s probably a dozen others like it nearby. Pleasent glow also. 7.', '2003-07-10 16:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(352593, 27978, 2612, '<td valign="top">I''ll start off by saying that I like this shot, so my comments don''t seem negative. I like all of the elements; fireworks, architecture, kayakers in the water. By eyes do seem to bounce between the building and the fireworks looking for a primary subject or a relationship. Developing a relationship between the two by position within the frame or line might help make a really good shot great. thanks for the enjoyable piece of work.</td>', 'I''ll start off by saying that I like this shot, so my comments don''t seem negative. I like all of the elements; fireworks, architecture, kayakers in the water. By eyes do seem to bounce between the building and the fireworks looking for a primary subject or a relationship. Developing a relationship between the two by position within the frame or line might help make a really good shot great. thanks for the enjoyable piece of work.', '2003-07-10 16:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(352595, 28000, 9886, '<td valign="top">Really like this - simple but effective I guess, gets you thinking. I think it would''ve been more elegant without the ankle bracelett but that''s just a minor detail on a really nicely composed shot. 8.</td>', 'Really like this - simple but effective I guess, gets you thinking. I think it would''ve been more elegant without the ankle bracelett but that''s just a minor detail on a really nicely composed shot. 8.', '2003-07-10 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(352596, 27814, 2612, '<td valign="top">The simple fact that I had to do a double take on this made it a lot of fun. The diagonal line and highlight at the bottom of the frame seem to draw my attention down, but the real attention should probably be in the hands, arms, and neck region. Still a lot of fun!</td>', 'The simple fact that I had to do a double take on this made it a lot of fun. The diagonal line and highlight at the bottom of the frame seem to draw my attention down, but the real attention should probably be in the hands, arms, and neck region. Still a lot of fun!', '2003-07-10 16:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(352600, 27343, 9886, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, the lights almost seem to explode where they converge. Reminds me of the cover of Artificial Intelligence. Slightly distracting glow to the left, but I think this is a good example of what is a common type of photo. 7.</td>', 'Awesome shot, the lights almost seem to explode where they converge. Reminds me of the cover of Artificial Intelligence. Slightly distracting glow to the left, but I think this is a good example of what is a common type of photo. 7.', '2003-07-10 16:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(352601, 27214, 2612, '<td valign="top">A lot of potential for an intersting shot. It''s a bit of a challenge without perspective control to make the verticles parallel, but the key thing to work on first is the focus. Long exposure at night probably caused shake. A tripod or setting the camera on a solid surface would probably help.</td>', 'A lot of potential for an intersting shot. It''s a bit of a challenge without perspective control to make the verticles parallel, but the key thing to work on first is the focus. Long exposure at night probably caused shake. A tripod or setting the camera on a solid surface would probably help.', '2003-07-10 16:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(352603, 27530, 9886, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but perhaps could''ve done with being more in focus and fitting in more of the fountain, both horizontally and vertically. Silhouette works like a dream here. I think this is definately more of an emotion than a photographical masterpiece - that''s a complement btw! 7.</td>', 'Nice idea, but perhaps could''ve done with being more in focus and fitting in more of the fountain, both horizontally and vertically. Silhouette works like a dream here. I think this is definately more of an emotion than a photographical masterpiece - that''s a complement btw! 7.', '2003-07-10 16:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(352605, 27801, 9886, '<td valign="top">NIce to see an unusual range of tones - even the silver is brown-ish. 7.</td>', 'NIce to see an unusual range of tones - even the silver is brown-ish. 7.', '2003-07-10 16:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(352607, 27642, 9886, '<td valign="top">Real nice, I love the kind of glossy water. Slightly too much purple fringing perhaps? But still, I think it''s great! 7.</td>', 'Real nice, I love the kind of glossy water. Slightly too much purple fringing perhaps? But still, I think it''s great! 7.', '2003-07-10 16:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(352611, 27872, 9886, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty amazing ... kind of old brickwork contrasted with new neon lighting. I didn''t notice this at first - I was just drawn to the shapes and looming green tower, but it''s nice now i''ve noticed it. Nicely done - 7.</td>', 'Looks pretty amazing ... kind of old brickwork contrasted with new neon lighting. I didn''t notice this at first - I was just drawn to the shapes and looming green tower, but it''s nice now i''ve noticed it. Nicely done - 7.', '2003-07-10 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(352616, 27789, 9886, '<td valign="top">Fantastic scene ... I love looking at all the different types of people. Clearly the architecture is the most striking feature, and it''s beautifully lit.Slightly distracting light on the flowers to the left, but other than that I love it. 7.</td>', 'Fantastic scene ... I love looking at all the different types of people. Clearly the architecture is the most striking feature, and it''s beautifully lit.Slightly distracting light on the flowers to the left, but other than that I love it. 7.', '2003-07-10 16:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(352624, 27393, 9886, '<td valign="top">Great idea ... i''m guessing the video is a Rom-Com! Slightly greenish tone is a bit off putting for me and it looks a little noise, but it gets marked up in my books for the innovation :)</td>', 'Great idea ... i''m guessing the video is a Rom-Com! Slightly greenish tone is a bit off putting for me and it looks a little noise, but it gets marked up in my books for the innovation :)', '2003-07-10 16:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(352625, 27830, 9886, '<td valign="top">I''d say this shot could do with some more foreground content for good measure - as it stands there''s a cityscape but not much more. Nicely levelled though ... one more city scape shot than i''ve ever taken!</td>', 'I''d say this shot could do with some more foreground content for good measure - as it stands there''s a cityscape but not much more. Nicely levelled though ... one more city scape shot than i''ve ever taken!', '2003-07-10 16:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(352629, 27945, 9886, '<td valign="top">The row of what looks like Buds (?) really lifts the shot, and the reflection off the door to the right had me puzzled for a while. Nice casual chit chat going on which I think you captured well.</td>', 'The row of what looks like Buds (?) really lifts the shot, and the reflection off the door to the right had me puzzled for a while. Nice casual chit chat going on which I think you captured well.', '2003-07-10 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(352632, 27981, 9886, '<td valign="top">Ooh this is all a bit funky! Lots of things to look at which I really appreciate. I''m glad it''s not in colour because that might''ve just got too confusing. 7.</td>', 'Ooh this is all a bit funky! Lots of things to look at which I really appreciate. I''m glad it''s not in colour because that might''ve just got too confusing. 7.', '2003-07-10 17:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
