(352847, 28008, 8953, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the black and white...If was just a little less exposed and the sign under the eve were not washed out it would have worked better for me.</td>', 'I like the idea of the black and white...If was just a little less exposed and the sign under the eve were not washed out it would have worked better for me.', '2003-07-11 01:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(352876, 27977, 8953, '<td valign="top">would loved to have seen both people...it is a nice shot just the same;) and it does feel like night life to me</td>', 'would loved to have seen both people...it is a nice shot just the same;) and it does feel like night life to me', '2003-07-11 01:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352886, 27530, 9027, '<td valign="top">love the silhohuette . and good use of border.</td>', 'love the silhohuette . and good use of border.', '2003-07-11 01:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(352888, 27801, 8953, '<td valign="top">this does say dinner. so it is night life. The crop seems a little tight and the light to bright. a candle or two would have made this work better for me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-16 00:06:37.</i></td>', 'this does say dinner. so it is night life. The crop seems a little tight and the light to bright. a candle or two would have made this work better for me.', '2003-07-11 01:48:15.000000', '2003-07-16 01:06:37.000000', 1),
(352896, 27901, 8981, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the set up of this photo, it has good dimension.  I also really liked the lighting!</td>', 'I enjoy the set up of this photo, it has good dimension.  I also really liked the lighting!', '2003-07-11 01:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(352897, 28007, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is alot of fun!  I really like the subject(s) of this.</td>', 'This is alot of fun!  I really like the subject(s) of this.', '2003-07-11 01:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352900, 27907, 8981, '<td valign="top">This could have gone for the speed challenge too. :)  I like the lighting of this, it seems very crisp.</td>', 'This could have gone for the speed challenge too. :)  I like the lighting of this, it seems very crisp.', '2003-07-11 01:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(352901, 27940, 8953, '<td valign="top">The scale of the shot is hard to see until you see the people on the rocks...that is a very bright light.</td>', 'The scale of the shot is hard to see until you see the people on the rocks...that is a very bright light.', '2003-07-11 01:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(352902, 27878, 8953, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2003-07-11 01:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352903, 27872, 8981, '<td valign="top">I really like this one!  All the neon lights give this a very "Night on the Town" look.  You''ve done very well!</td>', 'I really like this one!  All the neon lights give this a very "Night on the Town" look.  You''ve done very well!', '2003-07-11 01:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(352906, 27925, 8981, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  There''s no night life in my town either really.  I like the angle from which you shot this.  You captured the light levels very well in this!</td>', 'I really like this one.  There''s no night life in my town either really.  I like the angle from which you shot this.  You captured the light levels very well in this!', '2003-07-11 02:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(352908, 27871, 8981, '<td valign="top">You caught these fireworks at a very good time.  Congrats on your good timeing, that takes skill!</td>', 'You caught these fireworks at a very good time.  Congrats on your good timeing, that takes skill!', '2003-07-11 02:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(352912, 27350, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture!  There is so much depth in this shot and you caught the fireworks at a very impressive time.  I like the balance between the light''s reflecting in the water and the fireworks in the sky.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture!  There is so much depth in this shot and you caught the fireworks at a very impressive time.  I like the balance between the light''s reflecting in the water and the fireworks in the sky.', '2003-07-11 02:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(352913, 27334, 8981, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me laugh!  I like your thinking.  It''s also a very clear, crisp photo.  Good job.</td>', 'This picture makes me laugh!  I like your thinking.  It''s also a very clear, crisp photo.  Good job.', '2003-07-11 02:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(352916, 27981, 8981, '<td valign="top">I really like the layout of this photo!  There is so much to look at in it, but it doesn''t feel cluttered either.</td>', 'I really like the layout of this photo!  There is so much to look at in it, but it doesn''t feel cluttered either.', '2003-07-11 02:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(352919, 27969, 8981, '<td valign="top">Well, I know what you were going for in this and I applaud the attempt. Unfortunatly, you have one man standing still and it kind of ruins the effect of the other people.  I do like the lighting in this.</td>', 'Well, I know what you were going for in this and I applaud the attempt. Unfortunatly, you have one man standing still and it kind of ruins the effect of the other people.  I do like the lighting in this.', '2003-07-11 02:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(352920, 27649, 8981, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a very powerful photograph. The lighting is great and the angle works very well.  I almost missed the person in the left hand corner and I''m glad I didn''t, cause they make the entire pic.  Very Good Job!</td>', 'Wow, this is a very powerful photograph. The lighting is great and the angle works very well.  I almost missed the person in the left hand corner and I''m glad I didn''t, cause they make the entire pic.  Very Good Job!', '2003-07-11 02:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(352931, 27556, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but without the title, I wouldn''t have known it fit in the theme.</td>', 'beautiful shot, but without the title, I wouldn''t have known it fit in the theme.', '2003-07-11 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(352934, 27582, 9027, '<td valign="top">funny and disturbing at the same time. hehehe. I feel this is more of a portrait shot. It''d be nice to include some background to show some atmosphere.</td>', 'funny and disturbing at the same time. hehehe. I feel this is more of a portrait shot. It''d be nice to include some background to show some atmosphere.', '2003-07-11 02:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(352936, 27709, 9027, '<td valign="top">The sepia treatment really takes away from this image. It looks more like an old photo. Color would have added some energy to this.</td>', 'The sepia treatment really takes away from this image. It looks more like an old photo. Color would have added some energy to this.', '2003-07-11 02:29:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(352940, 27640, 9027, '<td valign="top">well captured moment. given the title, would have been nice to see some of those grandchildren in the shot. :o)</td>', 'well captured moment. given the title, would have been nice to see some of those grandchildren in the shot. :o)', '2003-07-11 02:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(352942, 27869, 9027, '<td valign="top">is there a significance to this particular street corner?</td>', 'is there a significance to this particular street corner?', '2003-07-11 02:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(352945, 27978, 9027, '<td valign="top">nicely framed image. i like the silohuette of the branches up top.</td>', 'nicely framed image. i like the silohuette of the branches up top.', '2003-07-11 02:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(352948, 27984, 9027, '<td valign="top">is he off to do his laundry? hehe. i think the neon lights help with the them, but the guy doens''t seem like he''s ready for a night on of town.</td>', 'is he off to do his laundry? hehe. i think the neon lights help with the them, but the guy doens''t seem like he''s ready for a night on of town.', '2003-07-11 02:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(352950, 27801, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautifully captured. i love the colors. elegant. but a bit too set up and artificial. maybe dim the lights, bring out the candles, and pour some wine. :o)</td>', 'beautifully captured. i love the colors. elegant. but a bit too set up and artificial. maybe dim the lights, bring out the candles, and pour some wine. :o)', '2003-07-11 02:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(352953, 27750, 9027, '<td valign="top">great perspective.</td>', 'great perspective.', '2003-07-11 02:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(352959, 27814, 9027, '<td valign="top">are those mannequins? wow, really lifelike. long long caption, but funny. :o)</td>', 'are those mannequins? wow, really lifelike. long long caption, but funny. :o)', '2003-07-11 02:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(352966, 27954, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice job. i like the composition and lighting. totally fits the theme. finally. :o)</td>', 'nice job. i like the composition and lighting. totally fits the theme. finally. :o)', '2003-07-11 02:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(352979, 27534, 9027, '<td valign="top">wow. beautiful view. i like the addition of people in the foreground.</td>', 'wow. beautiful view. i like the addition of people in the foreground.', '2003-07-11 02:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(352985, 27549, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautifully composed shot. love the colors. not quite in theme for me though. :o)</td>', 'beautifully composed shot. love the colors. not quite in theme for me though. :o)', '2003-07-11 02:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(352988, 27921, 9027, '<td valign="top">the sepia works well in this shot. great silohuette use. the people really make this picture for me. what''s a night out of town without people. :o)</td>', 'the sepia works well in this shot. great silohuette use. the people really make this picture for me. what''s a night out of town without people. :o)', '2003-07-11 02:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(352991, 27805, 9027, '<td valign="top">gorgeous fireworks shot. love it. but doesn''t quite fit the theme for me.</td>', 'gorgeous fireworks shot. love it. but doesn''t quite fit the theme for me.', '2003-07-11 02:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(353010, 27887, 9027, '<td valign="top">cute! I don''t think the thick border adds to the image though.</td>', 'cute! I don''t think the thick border adds to the image though.', '2003-07-11 03:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(353018, 27276, 9027, '<td valign="top">i think the b/w takes away from the image. i''d like to see the colors in the necklace.</td>', 'i think the b/w takes away from the image. i''d like to see the colors in the necklace.', '2003-07-11 03:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(353026, 27969, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice job. i like the bustling feel caused by the moving people and the b/w works really well. good angle. i love how that one tree arches.</td>', 'nice job. i like the bustling feel caused by the moving people and the b/w works really well. good angle. i love how that one tree arches.', '2003-07-11 03:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(353037, 27943, 9027, '<td valign="top">i wish there were fireworks! or something. too pitch dark. but love the pose.</td>', 'i wish there were fireworks! or something. too pitch dark. but love the pose.', '2003-07-11 03:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(353048, 27731, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful picture, it´s like a postcard</td>', 'Beatiful picture, it´s like a postcard', '2003-07-11 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(353049, 27457, 8682, '<td valign="top">Good job... good angle and good composition... 9</td>', 'Good job... good angle and good composition... 9', '2003-07-11 03:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(353050, 27343, 8682, '<td valign="top">Good job, I like the "speed" effect of the cars</td>', 'Good job, I like the "speed" effect of the cars', '2003-07-11 03:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(353052, 27556, 8682, '<td valign="top">wow, wow... beatiful sunset</td>', 'wow, wow... beatiful sunset', '2003-07-11 03:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(353144, 27277, 9073, '<td valign="top">The focus is too far off, as is the barrel distortion</td>', 'The focus is too far off, as is the barrel distortion', '2003-07-11 04:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(353150, 27975, 6172, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate your situtation.  The photo, of course, as I''m sure you know, doesn''t meet the challenge at all.  Sometimes we just have to use depression to inspire us, instead of surrendering to it.</td>', 'I can appreciate your situtation.  The photo, of course, as I''m sure you know, doesn''t meet the challenge at all.  Sometimes we just have to use depression to inspire us, instead of surrendering to it.', '2003-07-11 04:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(353154, 27276, 6172, '<td valign="top">Was this supposed to be submitted to this challenge?  It looks closer to "Nude" to me.  I guess in a stretch it could be interpeted as "getting ready to go out on the town".</td>', 'Was this supposed to be submitted to this challenge?  It looks closer to "Nude" to me.  I guess in a stretch it could be interpeted as "getting ready to go out on the town".', '2003-07-11 04:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(353156, 28009, 6172, '<td valign="top">File is extremely small.  Composition is too simplistic.  Not much here to look at.</td>', 'File is extremely small.  Composition is too simplistic.  Not much here to look at.', '2003-07-11 04:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(353161, 27884, 6172, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I like that frame at all.  The photo doesn''t really give me the feeling of a night out at all.  Just somebody who''s staying at home.</td>', 'Can''t say I like that frame at all.  The photo doesn''t really give me the feeling of a night out at all.  Just somebody who''s staying at home.', '2003-07-11 04:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(353162, 27906, 6172, '<td valign="top">Photo is extremely distorted.  Good idea, poor execution.</td>', 'Photo is extremely distorted.  Good idea, poor execution.', '2003-07-11 04:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(353166, 27985, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not bad, fireworks are hard to shoot!  I know, I was trying for my first time that night.  The composition could be greatly improved by adding some surrounding scenery that in some way could enhance the fireworks.  The better fireworks shots add a reflection off a lake, etc., for example.</td>', 'Not bad, fireworks are hard to shoot!  I know, I was trying for my first time that night.  The composition could be greatly improved by adding some surrounding scenery that in some way could enhance the fireworks.  The better fireworks shots add a reflection off a lake, etc., for example.', '2003-07-11 05:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(353173, 27296, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good exposure.  The shot seems a little bland, though, like there isn''t really anything to focus on.</td>', 'Nice colors, good exposure.  The shot seems a little bland, though, like there isn''t really anything to focus on.', '2003-07-11 05:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(353175, 27869, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not good focus, too much glare from the lights in the background.</td>', 'Not good focus, too much glare from the lights in the background.', '2003-07-11 05:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(353177, 27960, 6172, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that this is supposed to be out of focus to add to the effect?  Other than that the shot isn''t very creative.  Maybe you had too many to drink!  Alcohol kills brain cells.</td>', 'I''m guessing that this is supposed to be out of focus to add to the effect?  Other than that the shot isn''t very creative.  Maybe you had too many to drink!  Alcohol kills brain cells.', '2003-07-11 05:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(353180, 27903, 6172, '<td valign="top">Surely you know this photo sucks?  What is it?</td>', 'Surely you know this photo sucks?  What is it?', '2003-07-11 05:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(353181, 27350, 6172, '<td valign="top">Basically a perfect fireworks shot!  Great supporting scenery!  The only way this could have been any better was to have the fireworks reflecting off the water, also the crop could have been a little tighter.   I predict this one will place high.</td>', 'Basically a perfect fireworks shot!  Great supporting scenery!  The only way this could have been any better was to have the fireworks reflecting off the water, also the crop could have been a little tighter.   I predict this one will place high.', '2003-07-11 05:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(353183, 27214, 9073, '<td valign="top">The focus is too far off for this shot to work</td>', 'The focus is too far off for this shot to work', '2003-07-11 05:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(353185, 28001, 6172, '<td valign="top">ALWAYS use a pretty girl to add points to your photo!  Seriously, though, the photo is pretty good except for two things I saw.  The pretty girl has a white rod sticking out of the top of her head, and the horses eyes look evil (or something).  The horses eyes are a lighting problem, and the white rod could be alleviated by changeing the angle of your shot, which could have been better anyway if you could have shown more of the cart.</td>', 'ALWAYS use a pretty girl to add points to your photo!  Seriously, though, the photo is pretty good except for two things I saw.  The pretty girl has a white rod sticking out of the top of her head, and the horses eyes look evil (or something).  The horses eyes are a lighting problem, and the white rod could be alleviated by changeing the angle of your shot, which could have been better anyway if you could have shown more of the cart.', '2003-07-11 05:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(353187, 27789, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not fair!  You live (or vacation) somewhere like this!  Great detail, and colors and lighting!  Question - Was your lens clean?  There are 3 little spots on this photo almost dead center right above the buildings.  Was it your lens?</td>', 'Not fair!  You live (or vacation) somewhere like this!  Great detail, and colors and lighting!  Question - Was your lens clean?  There are 3 little spots on this photo almost dead center right above the buildings.  Was it your lens?', '2003-07-11 05:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(353190, 27904, 9073, '<td valign="top">If this is a quiz, you''ve given the answer already. As an image, this doesn''t work.</td>', 'If this is a quiz, you''ve given the answer already. As an image, this doesn''t work.', '2003-07-11 05:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(353200, 27869, 9073, '<td valign="top">The main subject is too out of focus here.</td>', 'The main subject is too out of focus here.', '2003-07-11 05:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(353211, 28000, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like this image. Only I''d rather see a little more tonal contrast, though.</td>', 'I like this image. Only I''d rather see a little more tonal contrast, though.', '2003-07-11 05:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(353220, 28008, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you add anything to this photo by going greyscale.  There really isn''t a classic look or a vintage look to make this a better picture by going b&amp;w.  It doesn''t have much going on in the photo and I think that really hurts it.</td>', 'I don''t think you add anything to this photo by going greyscale.  There really isn''t a classic look or a vintage look to make this a better picture by going b&w.  It doesn''t have much going on in the photo and I think that really hurts it.', '2003-07-11 05:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(353223, 27663, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good use of a perspective shot here and also using the title to tie it in.  It works very well for this challenge.   I''m not saying its a winner, but a pretty solid shot with a good idea behind it.</td>', 'Good use of a perspective shot here and also using the title to tie it in.  It works very well for this challenge.   I''m not saying its a winner, but a pretty solid shot with a good idea behind it.', '2003-07-11 05:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(353224, 27942, 3540, '<td valign="top">You mightve been best off staying away from that super extra bright light.  That really can play hell on an exposure.</td>', 'You mightve been best off staying away from that super extra bright light.  That really can play hell on an exposure.', '2003-07-11 06:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(353228, 27709, 9073, '<td valign="top">yummy!</td>', 'yummy!', '2003-07-11 06:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(353230, 27878, 3540, '<td valign="top">a little noise?  I''m guessing this is not on purpose, but I can''t imagine why.  If it was you camera, my condolences.  If it was on purpose... I don''t know what you gain by adding this much noise..</td>', 'a little noise?  I''m guessing this is not on purpose, but I can''t imagine why.  If it was you camera, my condolences.  If it was on purpose... I don''t know what you gain by adding this much noise..', '2003-07-11 06:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(353231, 27869, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little too soft.  This looks like if clearer, it would''ve been a really nice pic.  I''m not sure what greyscaling did for it, aside from taking away any problems there might''ve been with the lighting and such.  Good effort</td>', 'A little too soft.  This looks like if clearer, it would''ve been a really nice pic.  I''m not sure what greyscaling did for it, aside from taking away any problems there might''ve been with the lighting and such.  Good effort', '2003-07-11 06:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(353238, 27393, 3540, '<td valign="top">I can totally identify with this picture.  I even have a sippy cup or 3 just like the one on the right.  Might want to fix your background and the cloth on the table   They have some wrinkles.  Good luck with the family</td>', 'I can totally identify with this picture.  I even have a sippy cup or 3 just like the one on the right.  Might want to fix your background and the cloth on the table   They have some wrinkles.  Good luck with the family', '2003-07-11 06:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(353243, 27789, 3540, '<td valign="top">Yep, this is pretty grand.  Shame you had to cut off the top of the tower.</td>', 'Yep, this is pretty grand.  Shame you had to cut off the top of the tower.', '2003-07-11 06:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(353254, 27919, 3540, '<td valign="top">Should\''ve used a tripod.  Not enough available light to make this shot easily handheld.</td>', 'Should\''ve used a tripod.  Not enough available light to make this shot easily handheld.', '2003-07-11 06:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(353404, 27770, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but without the title, I would probably have a hard time figuring out what the picture is of.  The glass on the left looks more like milk than beer and the one on the right is so dark it gets lost.  A different angle on the ashtray might have worked better too, since you can''t really see what''s inside.</td>', 'I like the concept but without the title, I would probably have a hard time figuring out what the picture is of.  The glass on the left looks more like milk than beer and the one on the right is so dark it gets lost.  A different angle on the ashtray might have worked better too, since you can''t really see what''s inside.', '2003-07-11 09:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(353408, 27930, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is sweet (the title is wonderful!).  A nice contribution to the challenge. A little dark and I wish your couple were standing a little closer to one another. The woman in the background (with the white shirt, not so much the one in the dress) detracts from them and the gentleman''s facial expression is barely seen.</td>', 'This is sweet (the title is wonderful!).  A nice contribution to the challenge. A little dark and I wish your couple were standing a little closer to one another. The woman in the background (with the white shirt, not so much the one in the dress) detracts from them and the gentleman''s facial expression is barely seen.', '2003-07-11 09:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(353414, 27757, 9295, '<td valign="top">Wonderful human-interest shot.  I, for one, love the busy-ness of the counter and the shelves, and the placement of your focal point off to the left.  He kind of gets lost among the clutter...almost like camouflage so no one will see him sneaking a bite. LOL!</td>', 'Wonderful human-interest shot.  I, for one, love the busy-ness of the counter and the shelves, and the placement of your focal point off to the left.  He kind of gets lost among the clutter...almost like camouflage so no one will see him sneaking a bite. LOL!', '2003-07-11 09:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(353422, 27214, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too much out of focus. I wish you had been able to get all of the lettering readable. I do like the colors and placement on the page.</td>', 'This is a bit too much out of focus. I wish you had been able to get all of the lettering readable. I do like the colors and placement on the page.', '2003-07-11 09:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(353426, 27857, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract and well done dark-on-dark, but I don''t think it fits this challenge very well at all.  It does nothing to suggest night on the town, even stretching the definition of the challenge.  I do like the blue in the top left and the fact that you were able to capture your textures despite very limited lighting.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract and well done dark-on-dark, but I don''t think it fits this challenge very well at all.  It does nothing to suggest night on the town, even stretching the definition of the challenge.  I do like the blue in the top left and the fact that you were able to capture your textures despite very limited lighting.', '2003-07-11 10:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(353428, 27971, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool because you chose to focus on the crowd rather than the fireworks themselves.  My eye is drawn to the child in the front center of the picture since his face is just a bit lighter than the boy sitting closer to the camera. It''s a shame he wasn''t lit a little better since his body language and facial expression speak for the rest of the crowd.</td>', 'This is kind of cool because you chose to focus on the crowd rather than the fireworks themselves.  My eye is drawn to the child in the front center of the picture since his face is just a bit lighter than the boy sitting closer to the camera. It''s a shame he wasn''t lit a little better since his body language and facial expression speak for the rest of the crowd.', '2003-07-11 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(353429, 27640, 9295, '<td valign="top">A nice firework shot.</td>', 'A nice firework shot.', '2003-07-11 10:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(353430, 27919, 9295, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the effect of the lighting. I imagine you are going for that being the focus of the shot, but to me, it''s distracting and, with so many of them, it loses its effect.</td>', 'I don''t care for the effect of the lighting. I imagine you are going for that being the focus of the shot, but to me, it''s distracting and, with so many of them, it loses its effect.', '2003-07-11 10:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
