(354691, 27530, 9115, '<td valign="top">This idea works really well, with the dramatic lighting behind the couple who are almost silhouetted against it but just contain a little detail for added interest.  Very good!</td>', 'This idea works really well, with the dramatic lighting behind the couple who are almost silhouetted against it but just contain a little detail for added interest.  Very good!', '2003-07-12 15:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
