(354987, 27635, 5822, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if this scene was so bright in real life, but it appears to me to be overexposed.  While I like the perspective and how it leads the eye in, it leads to nothing interesting to view...the bridge/arch in the background is just too small to really appreciate.</td>', 'Don''t know if this scene was so bright in real life, but it appears to me to be overexposed.  While I like the perspective and how it leads the eye in, it leads to nothing interesting to view...the bridge/arch in the background is just too small to really appreciate.', '2003-07-13 01:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
