(355224, 28000, 5955, '<td valign="top">very nice implicit picture.</td>', 'very nice implicit picture.', '2003-07-13 14:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(355230, 27548, 8911, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo - it looks as though the camera moved during the slow exposure, though. Maybe use a tripod or something to brace it on such as a table or fencepost? Or just stubbornly take a lot of pictures (since I''m not sure if the area allowed you to set up any kind of bracing). The focus is really good - I would say I can read the signs, but I can only say they''re clear enough that they could be read in this case. :)</td>', 'An interesting photo - it looks as though the camera moved during the slow exposure, though. Maybe use a tripod or something to brace it on such as a table or fencepost? Or just stubbornly take a lot of pictures (since I''m not sure if the area allowed you to set up any kind of bracing). The focus is really good - I would say I can read the signs, but I can only say they''re clear enough that they could be read in this case. :)', '2003-07-13 14:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(355231, 27978, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I love the effect of the double-burst, the reflection on the water, and the boats out there showing people enjoying it - all add up to a lovely photo! The monument is a nice touch, too, though my attention goes first to the fireworks and their reflection.</td>', 'Nice shot. I love the effect of the double-burst, the reflection on the water, and the boats out there showing people enjoying it - all add up to a lovely photo! The monument is a nice touch, too, though my attention goes first to the fireworks and their reflection.', '2003-07-13 14:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
