(355380, 27750, 9723, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this show with the exception of the "star" effect. Other than that....wow! Nicely conceived. Well composed. Technically excellent.</td>', 'I like everything about this show with the exception of the "star" effect. Other than that....wow! Nicely conceived. Well composed. Technically excellent.', '2003-07-13 21:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(355382, 27872, 326, '<td valign="top">Great Job! Love the colors...</td>', 'Great Job! Love the colors...', '2003-07-13 21:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(355385, 27969, 8970, '<td valign="top">From the looks of the objects that should be stationary, this was taken without a tripod.  The blur effect of the people is very nice, however the objects that are stationary should look that way</td>', 'From the looks of the objects that should be stationary, this was taken without a tripod.  The blur effect of the people is very nice, however the objects that are stationary should look that way', '2003-07-13 21:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(355391, 27350, 9723, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Could have been a hair sharper, but that is nit piciing.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Could have been a hair sharper, but that is nit piciing.', '2003-07-13 21:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(355392, 27642, 4585, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Wonderful job!</td>', 'I love this!  Wonderful job!', '2003-07-13 21:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(355394, 27708, 9723, '<td valign="top">It''s big, bright, well composed, sharp and most importantly of all IT''S IN COLOR. I''M GIVING YOU 5 BONUS POINTS FOR SHOOTING IN COLOR.</td>', 'It''s big, bright, well composed, sharp and most importantly of all IT''S IN COLOR. I''M GIVING YOU 5 BONUS POINTS FOR SHOOTING IN COLOR.', '2003-07-13 21:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(355396, 27953, 9723, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot. The back lighting is killer and the fill flash is just enough.</td>', 'Impressive shot. The back lighting is killer and the fill flash is just enough.', '2003-07-13 22:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(355397, 27458, 9723, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colorful shot. Might be just a tad bright, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Wonderful colorful shot. Might be just a tad bright, but that''s just me.', '2003-07-13 22:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(355398, 27398, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love the golden light and the moody quality.</td>', 'Love the golden light and the moody quality.', '2003-07-13 22:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(355399, 27398, 9723, '<td valign="top">Good job. Subject has that "lost night lean" goin on. Like the lighting. Could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Good job. Subject has that "lost night lean" goin on. Like the lighting. Could have been a bit sharper.', '2003-07-13 22:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(355403, 27892, 9723, '<td valign="top">What an eyeful, and a great job of shooting it.</td>', 'What an eyeful, and a great job of shooting it.', '2003-07-13 22:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(355406, 27894, 6325, '<td valign="top">The person really makes the image more interesting. I like the soft, grainy look for this situation.</td>', 'The person really makes the image more interesting. I like the soft, grainy look for this situation.', '2003-07-13 22:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(355410, 27710, 6325, '<td valign="top">What great colors.</td>', 'What great colors.', '2003-07-13 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(355418, 27983, 6325, '<td valign="top">Oh, my. What''s the story here?</td>', 'Oh, my. What''s the story here?', '2003-07-13 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(355420, 27625, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well composed. The colored lights are a good focal point. Would like to have seen it a bit sharper.</td>', 'Well composed. The colored lights are a good focal point. Would like to have seen it a bit sharper.', '2003-07-13 22:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(355429, 27969, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the motion. Looks like fun.</td>', 'I like the motion. Looks like fun.', '2003-07-13 23:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(355435, 27710, 3306, '<td valign="top">My favorite. Great color.</td>', 'My favorite. Great color.', '2003-07-13 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(355436, 27801, 6325, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun meal coming up. Everything is very shiny and seems to loose detail. Maybe candle light to tone down the harshness.</td>', 'Looks like a fun meal coming up. Everything is very shiny and seems to loose detail. Maybe candle light to tone down the harshness.', '2003-07-13 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(355437, 27662, 9232, '<td valign="top">Composition<br/>I like the overall composition of this piece.  The invasive darkness (did you use some filter for this effect) that is lit only by the neon sign; the angles of the straight edges.  This works well as it cannot be anywhere except "on the town" and it is definitely nighttime.<br/> <br/>Color<br/>The overriding color in this composition is the red/white color from the neon sign.  The image almost tires and dries my eyes the way neon signs can at night.  Once again, I''m interested to find out how you achieved this color; through filtration or just camera settings.<br/> <br/>Lighting<br/>The lighting is where this photo takes on personlity.  The cropping is well selected in that the artist gives enough space to the image so that the viewer can see how the neon light is overpowered by the darkness of the night.  It takes little room on the right of the screen to see the power of the darkness.  The left side of the image takes more real estate to see the light diffuse.<br/> <br/>Focus<br/>The focus seems a little soft but that could be the effect of the neon light.<br/> <br/>Overall<br/>I like this image as it isn''t a bright picture of an area I''d be likely to venture into at night.  It is a darker, more flavorful area and the personality of this locale is captured in this photo of the neon sign that stands as a beacon for the whole area.<br/></td>', 'CompositionI like the overall composition of this piece.  The invasive darkness (did you use some filter for this effect) that is lit only by the neon sign; the angles of the straight edges.  This works well as it cannot be anywhere except "on the town" and it is definitely nighttime. ColorThe overriding color in this composition is the red/white color from the neon sign.  The image almost tires and dries my eyes the way neon signs can at night.  Once again, I''m interested to find out how you achieved this color; through filtration or just camera settings. LightingThe lighting is where this photo takes on personlity.  The cropping is well selected in that the artist gives enough space to the image so that the viewer can see how the neon light is overpowered by the darkness of the night.  It takes little room on the right of the screen to see the power of the darkness.  The left side of the image takes more real estate to see the light diffuse. FocusThe focus seems a little soft but that could be the effect of the neon light. OverallI like this image as it isn''t a bright picture of an area I''d be likely to venture into at night.  It is a darker, more flavorful area and the personality of this locale is captured in this photo of the neon sign that stands as a beacon for the whole area.', '2003-07-13 23:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(355440, 27750, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love the color, mood, and feeling of depth. One of my favorites. Good Job.</td>', 'Love the color, mood, and feeling of depth. One of my favorites. Good Job.', '2003-07-13 23:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(355442, 27807, 7778, '<td valign="top">One of the more exciting shots in this challenge. Love the dynamic created by the diagonal theme (of composition/framing/details). The motion blur ''jazzes'' this up very nicely and appropiately, given the topic. <br/> <br/>The orange tungsten is a bit too pervasive perhaps, and without ''any'' sharp definition inside the capture, it fails, IMHO, to satisfy an eye accustomed to an anchor point.<br/> <br/>Still, one of the better photographs here.</td>', 'One of the more exciting shots in this challenge. Love the dynamic created by the diagonal theme (of composition/framing/details). The motion blur ''jazzes'' this up very nicely and appropiately, given the topic.  The orange tungsten is a bit too pervasive perhaps, and without ''any'' sharp definition inside the capture, it fails, IMHO, to satisfy an eye accustomed to an anchor point. Still, one of the better photographs here.', '2003-07-13 23:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(355449, 27815, 6325, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the tilt treatment for this image - is it supposed to show something? Overall, the image seems over-exposed for a night scene. The light wrapped trees are pretty interesting, maybe concentrate on them.</td>', 'I don''t like the tilt treatment for this image - is it supposed to show something? Overall, the image seems over-exposed for a night scene. The light wrapped trees are pretty interesting, maybe concentrate on them.', '2003-07-13 23:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(355450, 27393, 6325, '<td valign="top">I think the subject fits. The lighitng is a little harsh.</td>', 'I think the subject fits. The lighitng is a little harsh.', '2003-07-13 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(355451, 27945, 9232, '<td valign="top">Composition<br/>Thie is a well-designed shot.  The main model is made more human, approachable and believable by the two other people in the shot.  The photo would not have as much impact with only the main person sitting at the counter.  The yellow light with the white light above it seems to give character to the locale selected for this shot.  The beer bottles over the counter speak of some story or local quirk that any regular of this bar would know.<br/> <br/>Color<br/>The washed out colors of the ligths behind the bar and the overpowered darkness of the subjects in teh foreground lend an exhilirating edge to the top of the photo that becomes more grounded as the viewer approaches the bottom of the image.  This could hint at some gritty realism that comes from a late night discussion with a stranger and a bar tender (or not).<br/> <br/>Lighting<br/>The lighting in this image evokes some emotion for me as the top of the image seems to promise a place that''s fun to be and then as your eyes trail down to the models/subjects you begin to get baser, more connected feeling.<br/> <br/>Focus<br/>The focus in this image is not sharp and that is not put to good use in this composition.  It doesn''t kill the emotions evoked by the rest of the presentation but the viewer could be brought in more easily if the main model''s head/face were in better focus.<br/> <br/>Overall<br/>I like this image.  I don''t think I would crop it any differently but I think a better focus would have given this picture a stronger voice with which to pull in viewers.</td>', 'CompositionThie is a well-designed shot.  The main model is made more human, approachable and believable by the two other people in the shot.  The photo would not have as much impact with only the main person sitting at the counter.  The yellow light with the white light above it seems to give character to the locale selected for this shot.  The beer bottles over the counter speak of some story or local quirk that any regular of this bar would know. ColorThe washed out colors of the ligths behind the bar and the overpowered darkness of the subjects in teh foreground lend an exhilirating edge to the top of the photo that becomes more grounded as the viewer approaches the bottom of the image.  This could hint at some gritty realism that comes from a late night discussion with a stranger and a bar tender (or not). LightingThe lighting in this image evokes some emotion for me as the top of the image seems to promise a place that''s fun to be and then as your eyes trail down to the models/subjects you begin to get baser, more connected feeling. FocusThe focus in this image is not sharp and that is not put to good use in this composition.  It doesn''t kill the emotions evoked by the rest of the presentation but the viewer could be brought in more easily if the main model''s head/face were in better focus. OverallI like this image.  I don''t think I would crop it any differently but I think a better focus would have given this picture a stronger voice with which to pull in viewers.', '2003-07-13 23:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(355453, 27942, 9493, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot i like how the light dances across the water nice work!</td>', 'very interesting shot i like how the light dances across the water nice work!', '2003-07-13 23:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(355456, 28009, 9232, '<td valign="top">I think this image was a good idea but it is so far away.  Couple that with my personal feeling that shooting neon lights will generally give you the impression of a softer focus.<br/> <br/>I think this image would be better if it was shot closer.</td>', 'I think this image was a good idea but it is so far away.  Couple that with my personal feeling that shooting neon lights will generally give you the impression of a softer focus. I think this image would be better if it was shot closer.', '2003-07-13 23:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(355457, 27938, 9493, '<td valign="top">wow hard to beleif its nite look at the swurlies coming down from the sky I LIKE IT!! this desurves a 9</td>', 'wow hard to beleif its nite look at the swurlies coming down from the sky I LIKE IT!! this desurves a 9', '2003-07-13 23:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(355460, 27223, 9493, '<td valign="top">hey i can see 4 of you how did you do that that is cool</td>', 'hey i can see 4 of you how did you do that that is cool', '2003-07-13 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(355461, 27291, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool picture!  I love the way the red car stands out in relief against the mostly blue/green skyline and the way the buildings and car seem to float in black space.  There are just a few improvements I would like to see. First, and foremost, the buildings lean right, and that could be corrected easily in a photoediting program like PS. Secondly, focus seems soft and finally,  I think the car should be placed off-center.  Otherwise, very creative and unique.  Love it!</td>', 'This is a really cool picture!  I love the way the red car stands out in relief against the mostly blue/green skyline and the way the buildings and car seem to float in black space.  There are just a few improvements I would like to see. First, and foremost, the buildings lean right, and that could be corrected easily in a photoediting program like PS. Secondly, focus seems soft and finally,  I think the car should be placed off-center.  Otherwise, very creative and unique.  Love it!', '2003-07-13 23:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(355468, 27870, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the DOF is very effective here.  What I don''t like: glass leans inward, excessive noise, harsh lighting (wish it were softer) and one of the pool balls behind the glass is slightly showing which I find to be distracting.  I would normally mark down for these flaws, but the composition and DOF is so strong that I"m going to give you a high mark.  I would hope you would make this available as a print once it''s cleaned up.  Good job!</td>', 'Love the composition and the DOF is very effective here.  What I don''t like: glass leans inward, excessive noise, harsh lighting (wish it were softer) and one of the pool balls behind the glass is slightly showing which I find to be distracting.  I would normally mark down for these flaws, but the composition and DOF is so strong that I"m going to give you a high mark.  I would hope you would make this available as a print once it''s cleaned up.  Good job!', '2003-07-14 00:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(355470, 27807, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft thougout the whole picture.   It would be much better had the woman on the left been in focus more since she seems to be the subject of your photo.</td>', 'Focus is too soft thougout the whole picture.   It would be much better had the woman on the left been in focus more since she seems to be the subject of your photo.', '2003-07-14 00:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(355471, 27771, 9493, '<td valign="top">oh i think i get it its night and he is ON TOP of the town, very creative</td>', 'oh i think i get it its night and he is ON TOP of the town, very creative', '2003-07-14 00:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(355476, 27872, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very effective night shot. I like the perspective created by the rings of light and it''s off-center placement. Also like the skyskraper in the background.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very effective night shot. I like the perspective created by the rings of light and it''s off-center placement. Also like the skyskraper in the background.  Nice job.', '2003-07-14 00:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(355478, 27662, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think you need a more interesting and compelling subject for your photo.  This just doesn''t say anything to me.</td>', 'I think you need a more interesting and compelling subject for your photo.  This just doesn''t say anything to me.', '2003-07-14 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(355480, 27802, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition...the only thing to improve there is the slightly cut off skyscrapper on the left.  Also, I would liked to have seen this picture darker with some more contrast to bring out the lights in the water and buildings.  I think this would also improve color saturation as well.  Good job on compostion!</td>', 'Very nice composition...the only thing to improve there is the slightly cut off skyscrapper on the left.  Also, I would liked to have seen this picture darker with some more contrast to bring out the lights in the water and buildings.  I think this would also improve color saturation as well.  Good job on compostion!', '2003-07-14 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(355485, 27978, 9493, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/114/27978.jpg</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast your vote...//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/114/27978.jpg', '2003-07-14 00:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(355487, 27978, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Outstanding capture!  This picture is very well balanced, even with the empty space in the upper left.  I love the way the two small boats are caught by the reflections in the water from their respective light sources.  Also, that''s one hell of a fireball fireworks! Almost seems to be a UFO out of Strange Encounters of the Third Kind.  Are you sure that it''s not really abducting earthlings? :)  Excellent job!</td>', 'Wow!!! Outstanding capture!  This picture is very well balanced, even with the empty space in the upper left.  I love the way the two small boats are caught by the reflections in the water from their respective light sources.  Also, that''s one hell of a fireball fireworks! Almost seems to be a UFO out of Strange Encounters of the Third Kind.  Are you sure that it''s not really abducting earthlings? :)  Excellent job!', '2003-07-14 00:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(355492, 27663, 5822, '<td valign="top">Effective symbolism and very well executed.  I like the way the glass glistens against the otherwise low key image and the way you''ve maintained detail in the tabletop.  Even the pitch black space in the upper left where the table ends is veyr effective, suggesting patron on floor?  One helluva an image! Good job.</td>', 'Effective symbolism and very well executed.  I like the way the glass glistens against the otherwise low key image and the way you''ve maintained detail in the tabletop.  Even the pitch black space in the upper left where the table ends is veyr effective, suggesting patron on floor?  One helluva an image! Good job.', '2003-07-14 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(355494, 27907, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and I think the compostion is excellent....very interesting to look at.  There is alot of noise, but hard to prevent in these night shots, and I''m wondering if you used a star filter...if you did, I think it''s overdone here with all those lights.  Good job on the night sky, as well, which is almost black.</td>', 'Very nice colors and I think the compostion is excellent....very interesting to look at.  There is alot of noise, but hard to prevent in these night shots, and I''m wondering if you used a star filter...if you did, I think it''s overdone here with all those lights.  Good job on the night sky, as well, which is almost black.', '2003-07-14 00:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(355495, 27968, 9493, '<td valign="top">nice photo mom i really think she should of been waiting for a date or someting but i''m glad you followed your own ideas and i have one more questian for you,  regret for what? send me an email with the awnser ok i rate your photo  10</td>', 'nice photo mom i really think she should of been waiting for a date or someting but i''m glad you followed your own ideas and i have one more questian for you,  regret for what? send me an email with the awnser ok i rate your photo  10', '2003-07-14 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(355498, 27871, 9493, '<td valign="top">very prettyful cristmas colors</td>', 'very prettyful cristmas colors', '2003-07-14 00:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(355499, 27981, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much, as well as, the texture and tones in the water.  Very interesting the way the boats are lining up and I especially like the 4 boats in the lower right.  They help to give a nice feeling of distance to the shot.  I''m wondering why you didn''t enter this image in color. I  think it would have looked better.</td>', 'I like the composition very much, as well as, the texture and tones in the water.  Very interesting the way the boats are lining up and I especially like the 4 boats in the lower right.  They help to give a nice feeling of distance to the shot.  I''m wondering why you didn''t enter this image in color. I  think it would have looked better.', '2003-07-14 00:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(355502, 27906, 5822, '<td valign="top">The lighting here seems awfully blown out and the foreground is so chaotic looking I can''t tell what anything is.  Hard to tell wheather your focus is off, or your exposure, or both or maybe a handheld camera at low shutter speed? I think this could be a wonderful image with some improvements.</td>', 'The lighting here seems awfully blown out and the foreground is so chaotic looking I can''t tell what anything is.  Hard to tell wheather your focus is off, or your exposure, or both or maybe a handheld camera at low shutter speed? I think this could be a wonderful image with some improvements.', '2003-07-14 00:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(355508, 28001, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been more effective if it weren''t taken straight away head on. I would have liked to have seen more of the carriage which would have provided more interest and would have helped tell a story.  The horse has the B&amp;W equivalent of red-eye and the woman has the horsewhip extending out of her head.  I think there are many ways of having had this subject show a "night out on the town,"  but you chose to make more of a snapshot of it.</td>', 'I think this picture would have been more effective if it weren''t taken straight away head on. I would have liked to have seen more of the carriage which would have provided more interest and would have helped tell a story.  The horse has the B&W equivalent of red-eye and the woman has the horsewhip extending out of her head.  I think there are many ways of having had this subject show a "night out on the town,"  but you chose to make more of a snapshot of it.', '2003-07-14 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(355537, 27938, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint to get these three monuments in one picture!  However, I wish you would have zoomed out a bit and used a portrait format to include all of the Wash monument  and get the fireworks in the shot too. Although the picture has excessive noise, I like way you''ve captured the smoke from the fireworks and I like the trees in the forground.  I do wish you would have cropped out the street lamps at the very bottom of the picture.</td>', 'Great viewpoint to get these three monuments in one picture!  However, I wish you would have zoomed out a bit and used a portrait format to include all of the Wash monument  and get the fireworks in the shot too. Although the picture has excessive noise, I like way you''ve captured the smoke from the fireworks and I like the trees in the forground.  I do wish you would have cropped out the street lamps at the very bottom of the picture.', '2003-07-14 01:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(355566, 27830, 8580, '<td valign="top">Focus appears to be a little soft</td>', 'Focus appears to be a little soft', '2003-07-14 01:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(355720, 27578, 9602, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but seems alittle oversaturated by the light.</td>', 'Nice idea, but seems alittle oversaturated by the light.', '2003-07-14 07:27:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(355757, 27276, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the lighting here, but also wish it were a bit darker.  The existing lighting brings more attention to your model''s beautiful creamy skin,  round lips and breasts (as much as I can see of them :)  With the lighting accent more on the body than on the jewelry I think this photo is more fitting a "bedroom" challenge...not that I find that to be objectionable at all :)   I think dramatic lighting would be more appropriate for a "night on the town" challenge where a spotlight  directed on to this ornate and beautiful necklace would bring out it''s importance and luster.  Also, I would have preferred this picture with the necklace in color, and the rest of the photo in B&amp;W...and would want to see a slightly more contrasting background, but not so much so as the background is the same tone as the model''s skin.</td>', 'I like the softness of the lighting here, but also wish it were a bit darker.  The existing lighting brings more attention to your model''s beautiful creamy skin,  round lips and breasts (as much as I can see of them :)  With the lighting accent more on the body than on the jewelry I think this photo is more fitting a "bedroom" challenge...not that I find that to be objectionable at all :)   I think dramatic lighting would be more appropriate for a "night on the town" challenge where a spotlight  directed on to this ornate and beautiful necklace would bring out it''s importance and luster.  Also, I would have preferred this picture with the necklace in color, and the rest of the photo in B&W...and would want to see a slightly more contrasting background, but not so much so as the background is the same tone as the model''s skin.', '2003-07-14 09:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(355799, 27398, 7994, '<td valign="top">i think in b/w it would make more impression</td>', 'i think in b/w it would make more impression', '2003-07-14 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
