(357281, 27872, 4877, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Very interesting scene...  Love the range of colours and the lighting you''ve captured.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great shot.  Very interesting scene...  Love the range of colours and the lighting you''ve captured.  Good luck!', '2003-07-15 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(357288, 27607, 6679, '<td valign="top">Not sure it fits night on the town challenge but the colors are very intriguing.</td>', 'Not sure it fits night on the town challenge but the colors are very intriguing.', '2003-07-15 23:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(357289, 27882, 4877, '<td valign="top">This shot is a great depiction of a "night on the town".  I like the fast paced action feel that you get with the motion blur.  Beautiful colour tones as well.  I''d have liked the image a bit bigger though. Hope this does well.  Good luck!</td>', 'This shot is a great depiction of a "night on the town".  I like the fast paced action feel that you get with the motion blur.  Beautiful colour tones as well.  I''d have liked the image a bit bigger though. Hope this does well.  Good luck!', '2003-07-15 23:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(357291, 27549, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo!  I like the choice of subject, the architecture is what makes this shot so appealing.  I like your subtle border too.  Composition is excellent, with the fence in the foreground.  I know its difficult with night photography, but the top is slighly over-exposed.  Depending on your camera, maybe a graduated filter would help in this situation.</td>', 'Very nice photo!  I like the choice of subject, the architecture is what makes this shot so appealing.  I like your subtle border too.  Composition is excellent, with the fence in the foreground.  I know its difficult with night photography, but the top is slighly over-exposed.  Depending on your camera, maybe a graduated filter would help in this situation.', '2003-07-15 23:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(357296, 27886, 4877, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Gives the impression you had a "back stage pass"!  Artificial lighting was handled well.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Gives the impression you had a "back stage pass"!  Artificial lighting was handled well.', '2003-07-15 23:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(357298, 28000, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very elegant photo!  I like the B&amp;W.  Only suggestion would be a better choice of ground, without the scratch marks? next to the heel of the shoe.  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Very elegant photo!  I like the B&W.  Only suggestion would be a better choice of ground, without the scratch marks? next to the heel of the shoe.  Well done and good luck!', '2003-07-15 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(357299, 27933, 8155, '<td valign="top">Where everyone knows your name!</td>', 'Where everyone knows your name!', '2003-07-15 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(357301, 27925, 4877, '<td valign="top">Great architecture.  Well taken photo in the lighting conditions...  Thats a great composition using the pillar to block out the direct light.  Great photo idea since you dont have any "night life in [your] town"...</td>', 'Great architecture.  Well taken photo in the lighting conditions...  Thats a great composition using the pillar to block out the direct light.  Great photo idea since you dont have any "night life in [your] town"...', '2003-07-15 23:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(357302, 27214, 8155, '<td valign="top">Bit Grainy, looks like it was taken with a webcam.</td>', 'Bit Grainy, looks like it was taken with a webcam.', '2003-07-15 23:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(357304, 27789, 4877, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  A couple of small suggestions though:  the photo seems to be slightly off balance (to the horozontal), and maybe a levels/curves adjustment would have reduced some of the "haze" effect.  Great choice of subject and it certainly depicts a "night on the town".  High marks.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  A couple of small suggestions though:  the photo seems to be slightly off balance (to the horozontal), and maybe a levels/curves adjustment would have reduced some of the "haze" effect.  Great choice of subject and it certainly depicts a "night on the town".  High marks.  Good luck.', '2003-07-15 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(357305, 27977, 4877, '<td valign="top">Great concept for this photo.  I like the use of B&amp;W and the border works well on this one.  My only suggestion would be a slightly sharper image.  The composition is very well done.  Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Great concept for this photo.  I like the use of B&W and the border works well on this one.  My only suggestion would be a slightly sharper image.  The composition is very well done.  Keep up the great work!', '2003-07-15 23:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
