(357311, 27968, 4877, '<td valign="top">Great concept and well executed.  It certainly fits the challenge.  Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Great concept and well executed.  It certainly fits the challenge.  Keep up the great work!', '2003-07-15 23:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
