(357315, 27710, 6804, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this photo, is WOW, great color.<br/> <br/>After I ponder a bit, I think, these are only apartments. There is nothing going on here. There is no out on the town here at all. Then I think to myself Myself, these apartments are empty because the people are all "out on the town". <br/> <br/>This is a good shot - 9<br/></td>', 'My first reaction to this photo, is WOW, great color. After I ponder a bit, I think, these are only apartments. There is nothing going on here. There is no out on the town here at all. Then I think to myself Myself, these apartments are empty because the people are all "out on the town".  This is a good shot - 9', '2003-07-15 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
