(357319, 27335, 5400, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract feel here</td>', 'Interesting abstract feel here', '2003-07-15 23:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(357320, 27857, 4877, '<td valign="top">Interesting and artistic shot.  I''m afraid it doesnt quite fit the challenge in my opinion, but  I like your composition!  The textures are very nice.  I''d have liked to see slightly more light (maybe a reflected source) to brighten up the texture while not adding too much brightness to the metal type surface on the left.  You have a good eye for photography.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Interesting and artistic shot.  I''m afraid it doesnt quite fit the challenge in my opinion, but  I like your composition!  The textures are very nice.  I''d have liked to see slightly more light (maybe a reflected source) to brighten up the texture while not adding too much brightness to the metal type surface on the left.  You have a good eye for photography.  Keep it up!', '2003-07-15 23:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(357321, 27334, 8964, '<td valign="top">thats really funny</td>', 'thats really funny', '2003-07-15 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(357323, 27904, 4877, '<td valign="top">I can vaguely tell what the subject is in this photo, but it doesnt capture my attention and I''m not sure it fits the challenge.  Interesting concept though.  Keep it up!</td>', 'I can vaguely tell what the subject is in this photo, but it doesnt capture my attention and I''m not sure it fits the challenge.  Interesting concept though.  Keep it up!', '2003-07-15 23:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(357327, 27277, 4877, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Looking forward to finding out where it was taken!  My suggestions would be:  a slightly sharper image would have had more impact on me personally, and the bright light at the right edge of the frame seems to be adding a lense flare just above the trees in the centre of the image.  Maybe composing the photo slightly to the left, and/or using a lens hood would have minimised or removed that.  I love the architecture and the mood you have captured!  Well done!</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Looking forward to finding out where it was taken!  My suggestions would be:  a slightly sharper image would have had more impact on me personally, and the bright light at the right edge of the frame seems to be adding a lense flare just above the trees in the centre of the image.  Maybe composing the photo slightly to the left, and/or using a lens hood would have minimised or removed that.  I love the architecture and the mood you have captured!  Well done!', '2003-07-15 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(357328, 27938, 4877, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!</td>', 'Very nice shot!', '2003-07-15 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(357329, 27801, 4877, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but it almost seems too sharp, or there is some compression loss in the image.  Great concept though.  Love the colour ranges you have used, and the composition is very nice!</td>', 'I really like this photo, but it almost seems too sharp, or there is some compression loss in the image.  Great concept though.  Love the colour ranges you have used, and the composition is very nice!', '2003-07-15 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
