(358105, 27710, 9854, '<td valign="top">Hi folks, thanks for the "generous" comments. Would you believe that this picture was taken from the 10th floor of my building? I live in what I call, the pin-cushion district of HK (the buildings look like a dense patch of needles in a pin cushion when viewed from Victoria Peak). From my window, I would have to angle my camera way down for you to see the bars. For those of you who know Hong Kong, the kilometer-long escalator (going from the left side of the picture) is situated between the peach-colored middle tower and the pink walled low-rise building.</td>', 'Hi folks, thanks for the "generous" comments. Would you believe that this picture was taken from the 10th floor of my building? I live in what I call, the pin-cushion district of HK (the buildings look like a dense patch of needles in a pin cushion when viewed from Victoria Peak). From my window, I would have to angle my camera way down for you to see the bars. For those of you who know Hong Kong, the kilometer-long escalator (going from the left side of the picture) is situated between the peach-colored middle tower and the pink walled low-rise building.', '2003-07-16 08:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(358118, 27813, 7889, '<td valign="top">I was dissapointed this did not do better, i gave it my top mark. I dont understand some of the comments you have received its a great photo. Best of luck for the future.</td>', 'I was dissapointed this did not do better, i gave it my top mark. I dont understand some of the comments you have received its a great photo. Best of luck for the future.', '2003-07-16 08:15:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(358132, 27530, 8522, '<td valign="top">Ooops... didn''t realise the models would be reading this!<br/>I think it could have looked better if you two were holding hands or a little closer, it''s the way that your torsos are turned away from each other a little that spoils it for me.<br/>Anyway, my best to the both of you!</td>', 'Ooops... didn''t realise the models would be reading this!I think it could have looked better if you two were holding hands or a little closer, it''s the way that your torsos are turned away from each other a little that spoils it for me.Anyway, my best to the both of you!', '2003-07-16 08:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
