(358305, 28000, 8159, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who took the time to comment!<br/> <br/>I also wish the ground was "more attractive", but this was a last-minute idea, taken with less than an hour to go before the challenge deadline, so shot setup was minimal. This was shot in the garage, and was taken wherever the car happened to be parked...<br/> <br/>Ideally I would have liked to have had her stepping out on to a red carpet, or next to something that implied a curb, etc. but there was no way I was going to be able to convince her to drive around and then stick her leg out while I took a bunch pictures. (As it was, the neighbors were probably wondering what all the flashes in our garage were!)<br/> <br/>I really wish some of the people who voted this a 1, 2, 3 or 4 would have left some feedback as to why they thought it "sucked". The 25 people who left comments seemed to like it (average vote for commenters: 8.300).</td>', 'Thanks to all who took the time to comment! I also wish the ground was "more attractive", but this was a last-minute idea, taken with less than an hour to go before the challenge deadline, so shot setup was minimal. This was shot in the garage, and was taken wherever the car happened to be parked... Ideally I would have liked to have had her stepping out on to a red carpet, or next to something that implied a curb, etc. but there was no way I was going to be able to convince her to drive around and then stick her leg out while I took a bunch pictures. (As it was, the neighbors were probably wondering what all the flashes in our garage were!) I really wish some of the people who voted this a 1, 2, 3 or 4 would have left some feedback as to why they thought it "sucked". The 25 people who left comments seemed to like it (average vote for commenters: 8.300).', '2003-07-16 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(358366, 27762, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>Even without the title the first thought I got was he is sitting there passing the time waiting for his date to show up so I guess that said the title works with the photo.<br/> <br/>Overall the focus of this photo is good and there is a definate limited dof keeping the man in the photo the primary subject.<br/> <br/>I feel like there is something missing through, perhaps a little more of the atmosphere being recognizable would have made it score higher than it did.<br/> <br/>It meets the challenge and definately does have an appeal to it, nicely done and I will be looking forward to seeing more of your work.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', 'Critique Club Even without the title the first thought I got was he is sitting there passing the time waiting for his date to show up so I guess that said the title works with the photo. Overall the focus of this photo is good and there is a definate limited dof keeping the man in the photo the primary subject. I feel like there is something missing through, perhaps a little more of the atmosphere being recognizable would have made it score higher than it did. It meets the challenge and definately does have an appeal to it, nicely done and I will be looking forward to seeing more of your work. Anna', '2003-07-16 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
