(359199, 27921, 9959, '<td valign="top">This is a good nightshot and great fireworks capture. I like the dark people and the reflection in the water of the fireworks.<br/></td>', 'This is a good nightshot and great fireworks capture. I like the dark people and the reflection in the water of the fireworks.', '2003-07-16 19:19:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(359203, 27398, 7758, '<td valign="top">Matt, you were robbed!<br/>This should have finished top 3..... this epitomises my view of a night on the town. Didn''t comment on any night on the town shots but this was my fave! Everything about it reminds me of way too many Saturday nights! Great work Matt, keep shooting.<br/> <br/>Todd.</td>', 'Matt, you were robbed!This should have finished top 3..... this epitomises my view of a night on the town. Didn''t comment on any night on the town shots but this was my fave! Everything about it reminds me of way too many Saturday nights! Great work Matt, keep shooting. Todd.', '2003-07-16 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(359229, 27986, 9582, '<td valign="top">Yes, this was taken in Daytona.  It was taken around 7:30 pm which was the beginning of a night on the town, so I feel that it met the challenge. So, what time do you think that "night" officially begins?</td>', 'Yes, this was taken in Daytona.  It was taken around 7:30 pm which was the beginning of a night on the town, so I feel that it met the challenge. So, what time do you think that "night" officially begins?', '2003-07-16 19:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(359249, 27813, 1368, '<td valign="top">Mér finnst þessi mynd massakúl og ein af fáum í þessari keppni sem gefa manni virkilega night out fíling. Mér finnst flott sjónarhornið Þó kallarnir eru pínu teiknimyndalegir ;)  Ég gaf henni 8</td>', 'Mér finnst þessi mynd massakúl og ein af fáum í þessari keppni sem gefa manni virkilega night out fíling. Mér finnst flott sjónarhornið Þó kallarnir eru pínu teiknimyndalegir ;)  Ég gaf henni 8', '2003-07-16 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(359258, 27732, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s a low score!  Looking back, I can see that my composition is too static.  But I was really kind of proud of this image!  Hadn''t done any fireworks pictures that came out before.  And for us, a night "on" the town is staying home.  This was taken from our front deck, where we watched five different displays going at once.  It was very peaceful, but at the same time gave us a chance to observe the bustle of a night on the town without actually being out in it.<br/> <br/>Anyone who didn''t comment, please feel free to comment now and tell me what I could have done to better convey the mood I was going for.  Criticism will only help me improve!  Would cropping have helped, or is there just no way to express what I want with this subject?<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Wow.  That''s a low score!  Looking back, I can see that my composition is too static.  But I was really kind of proud of this image!  Hadn''t done any fireworks pictures that came out before.  And for us, a night "on" the town is staying home.  This was taken from our front deck, where we watched five different displays going at once.  It was very peaceful, but at the same time gave us a chance to observe the bustle of a night on the town without actually being out in it. Anyone who didn''t comment, please feel free to comment now and tell me what I could have done to better convey the mood I was going for.  Criticism will only help me improve!  Would cropping have helped, or is there just no way to express what I want with this subject? Thanks!', '2003-07-16 20:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(359370, 27750, 51, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture; really nice work!</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture; really nice work!', '2003-07-16 22:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
