(363184, 27884, 6611, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ChrisW123:</b></div><hr/><i>How did you get the shadow look to the border?  I like that.  Also looks like there''s extra shadow in the corners.... that part may not be legal.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hey,<br/> <br/>I add 2x2 pixels white and black borders arround the picture.<br/>No extra shadow in the corners.</td>', 'Originally posted by ChrisW123:How did you get the shadow look to the border?  I like that.  Also looks like there''s extra shadow in the corners.... that part may not be legal. Hey, I add 2x2 pixels white and black borders arround the picture.No extra shadow in the corners.', '2003-07-22 04:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
