(365644, 27732, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think a much tighter crop (depending on the zoom available I guess) may have helped this photo.  It looks like a great shot of the firework but it''s just too small.<br/> <br/>Also, I think the title probably didn''t help this picture - it''s a little difficult to understand your intentions initially.  Perhaps something like "Observing a night on the town from a distance" or something more catchy.<br/> <br/>I''ve never tried a shot like this so I don''t really appreciate how difficult it is.  For the distance involve the shot looks quite good but the detail is too small.  I guess the ideal situation would have been several fireworks spread out over a wide area and a very panoramic crop to show the expanse of the city.</td>', 'I think a much tighter crop (depending on the zoom available I guess) may have helped this photo.  It looks like a great shot of the firework but it''s just too small. Also, I think the title probably didn''t help this picture - it''s a little difficult to understand your intentions initially.  Perhaps something like "Observing a night on the town from a distance" or something more catchy. I''ve never tried a shot like this so I don''t really appreciate how difficult it is.  For the distance involve the shot looks quite good but the detail is too small.  I guess the ideal situation would have been several fireworks spread out over a wide area and a very panoramic crop to show the expanse of the city.', '2003-07-24 01:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
