(538964, 27668, 15703, '<td valign="top">The little dab of lens flare is unfortunate. My eye was drawn to it immediately because I use a flare-prone 28mm lens pretty-much all the time, so flare often sneaks up on me, too. The road being topped-off with a litter bin doesn''t help the elegance of the shot. However, I do like the scene overall, and the light levels have created a real mood for me to enjoy.</td>', 'The little dab of lens flare is unfortunate. My eye was drawn to it immediately because I use a flare-prone 28mm lens pretty-much all the time, so flare often sneaks up on me, too. The road being topped-off with a litter bin doesn''t help the elegance of the shot. However, I do like the scene overall, and the light levels have created a real mood for me to enjoy.', '2004-01-11 17:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(753679, 27925, 714, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot here.  I really like the lighting. Nice and clear shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot here.  I really like the lighting. Nice and clear shot!', '2004-06-07 17:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(793274, 27921, 714, '<td valign="top">2 more days and time square will be showing this shot.  Great shot and congrats!</td>', '2 more days and time square will be showing this shot.  Great shot and congrats!', '2004-07-03 01:48:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1285432, 27977, 35352, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It sums up everything about the situation. It so works that you don''t see who she''s talking to. It makes it all mysterious - how flirting should be. Her face and smile are so appealing, so friendly and inviting. Yet you can still see the guarding - she doesn''t know this person well. She doesn''t trust them. She''s revealing all these good qualities about herself yet is ready to bail if need be. I love how the background is blurred out - it''s only her and this unknown person. The world around is insignificant. And I think the differing levels on the wine glasses is very symbolic! These two people are different and while how fast someone drinks doesn''t say alot about them, it adds the mystery of this unknown person. It also confirms that we don''t need to see them.</td>', 'I love this photo. It sums up everything about the situation. It so works that you don''t see who she''s talking to. It makes it all mysterious - how flirting should be. Her face and smile are so appealing, so friendly and inviting. Yet you can still see the guarding - she doesn''t know this person well. She doesn''t trust them. She''s revealing all these good qualities about herself yet is ready to bail if need be. I love how the background is blurred out - it''s only her and this unknown person. The world around is insignificant. And I think the differing levels on the wine glasses is very symbolic! These two people are different and while how fast someone drinks doesn''t say alot about them, it adds the mystery of this unknown person. It also confirms that we don''t need to see them.', '2005-04-12 09:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1446727, 27757, 31738, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It''s a pleasure to see photos of the city my parents were born in because I don''t get to visit the city that much. Good clutter also, like it very much.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-10 20:16:54.</i></td>', 'Great photo. It''s a pleasure to see photos of the city my parents were born in because I don''t get to visit the city that much. Good clutter also, like it very much.', '2005-06-10 21:16:33.000000', '2005-06-10 21:16:54.000000', 0),
(1496488, 27815, 25397, '<td valign="top">A tilt works with this, but you need to either go all out (more tilt so it looks like you meant to tilt it, regardless of the title) or no tilt at all.</td>', 'A tilt works with this, but you need to either go all out (more tilt so it looks like you meant to tilt it, regardless of the title) or no tilt at all.', '2005-06-30 23:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
